# Outfit body (R18): a cropped, puffy bomber jacket: a thick top-heavy body ending above the hips on a gathered
# (inset) accent waistband, rounded stepped sleeve caps hanging past the shoulders over the upper arms, a big accent
# collar, steel zip, a glowing sleeve patch. Torso inside x 2..9, y 3..11 (pivot 5 7 0 on spine_03).
